RetroPie Installation Summary
==============================

VM IP:    {{ ansible_host }}
SSH:      ssh {{ retropie_user }}@{{ ansible_host }}
Hostname: {{ inventory_hostname }}

What was automated:
  - System packages updated
  - RetroPie dependencies installed
  - '{{ retropie_user }}' user created
  - RetroPie-Setup cloned to {{ retropie_install_dir }}
  - Basic emulators installed
  - EmulationStation set to auto-start on local console login

What still needs manual setup (connect via SSH or Proxmox console):
  1. Controller / input device mapping in EmulationStation
  2. Upload ROMs to ~/RetroPie/roms/<system>/
  3. Run scraper for artwork: Scraper menu in EmulationStation
  4. Per-emulator config in RetroArch (RGUI in-game menu)
  5. Audio/video settings (resolution, refresh rate)
  6. Optional: enable SAMBA for ROM transfers over network

Useful commands:
  - sudo {{ retropie_install_dir }}/retropie_setup.sh  : RetroPie config menu
  - emulationstation                                     : Start frontend manually
  - retroarch                                            : Launch RetroArch directly
